    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Silly Tanks </strong>is a 2-6 player Arcade-style PvP game with combat focusing on unique tanks. Make your tank, build maps, and fight your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BATTLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993320/extras/c7de715c6045cd33657f9f27a0b25fc9.poster.avif?t=1751565165\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993320/extras/c7de715c6045cd33657f9f27a0b25fc9.webm?t=1751565165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993320/extras/c7de715c6045cd33657f9f27a0b25fc9.mp4?t=1751565165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dominate the battlefield!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play to your tank's strengths to defeat enemies and claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight alone or with teammates, focus on kills or objectives to win across four classic game modes: Free for All, Team Death Match, Capture the Flag, and King of the Hill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993320/extras/41b834dced09908ef14ebcfa4c9d7937.poster.avif?t=1751565165\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993320/extras/41b834dced09908ef14ebcfa4c9d7937.webm?t=1751565165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993320/extras/41b834dced09908ef14ebcfa4c9d7937.mp4?t=1751565165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your own tank!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, choose the turret for how you want to dispatch your foes: use the <i>Spear</i> to hunt down distant enemies with a guided missile, or use the <i>Shotgun</i> to get up close and personal, dealing massive damage instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Next, choose the body for the unique movement you want: fly over hazards and sneak outside the map with the <i>UFO</i>, or pick the\u00a0<i>Teleporter</i> to menacingly appear right next to enemies when they least expect it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish it all off with a fresh paint-job of your favorite color, making it your tank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993320/extras/6db0c5b82d45862be22bc82359425562.poster.avif?t=1751565165\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993320/extras/6db0c5b82d45862be22bc82359425562.webm?t=1751565165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993320/extras/6db0c5b82d45862be22bc82359425562.mp4?t=1751565165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get creative!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The in-game map editor allows you to create your own maps to play on and share.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make use of a palette of destructible and indestructible cover, create tactical advantages with props, and define gameplay with objectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Game Modes</strong> to battle alone or with a team, focusing on kills or objectives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Lobbies</strong> make hosting and joining games easy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize</strong> your tank with parts that offer unique movement and ways to engage in combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Map Editing </strong>allows for creation and sharing of custom maps</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Silly Tanks </strong>is a 2-6 player Arcade-style PvP game with combat focusing on unique tanks. Make your tank, build maps, and fight your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BATTLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993320/extras/c7de715c6045cd33657f9f27a0b25fc9.poster.avif?t=1751565165\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993320/extras/c7de715c6045cd33657f9f27a0b25fc9.webm?t=1751565165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993320/extras/c7de715c6045cd33657f9f27a0b25fc9.mp4?t=1751565165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dominate the battlefield!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play to your tank's strengths to defeat enemies and claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight alone or with teammates, focus on kills or objectives to win across four classic game modes: Free for All, Team Death Match, Capture the Flag, and King of the Hill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993320/extras/41b834dced09908ef14ebcfa4c9d7937.poster.avif?t=1751565165\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993320/extras/41b834dced09908ef14ebcfa4c9d7937.webm?t=1751565165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993320/extras/41b834dced09908ef14ebcfa4c9d7937.mp4?t=1751565165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your own tank!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, choose the turret for how you want to dispatch your foes: use the <i>Spear</i> to hunt down distant enemies with a guided missile, or use the <i>Shotgun</i> to get up close and personal, dealing massive damage instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Next, choose the body for the unique movement you want: fly over hazards and sneak outside the map with the <i>UFO</i>, or pick the\u00a0<i>Teleporter</i> to menacingly appear right next to enemies when they least expect it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish it all off with a fresh paint-job of your favorite color, making it your tank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993320/extras/6db0c5b82d45862be22bc82359425562.poster.avif?t=1751565165\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993320/extras/6db0c5b82d45862be22bc82359425562.webm?t=1751565165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993320/extras/6db0c5b82d45862be22bc82359425562.mp4?t=1751565165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get creative!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The in-game map editor allows you to create your own maps to play on and share.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make use of a palette of destructible and indestructible cover, create tactical advantages with props, and define gameplay with objectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Game Modes</strong> to battle alone or with a team, focusing on kills or objectives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Lobbies</strong> make hosting and joining games easy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize</strong> your tank with parts that offer unique movement and ways to engage in combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Map Editing </strong>allows for creation and sharing of custom maps</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Choose a turret and a body to make your own tank to shoot, blast, and burn friends to claim your victory! Play classic game modes like Free for All, Team Death Match, Capture the Flag, and King of the Hill on your own custom-made maps in Silly Tanks.",
